    │ ├── Port 8080: Dashboard (Python HTTP server trên Windows)
    │ ├── Port 3000: OpenHands UI (→ Docker -p 3000:3000)
    │ └── Port proxy (netsh portproxy): 3006, 5173-5178, 3001 → WSL IP
    │
    ▼
WSL2 Ubuntu
    │ ├── Vite dev apps (npm run dev:apps) ← DEV SERVER CHẠY Ở ĐÂY
    │ ├── API server (port 3001)
    │ └── Docker
